From: Vasilii Zolotukhin <vasilii.zolotukhin@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 08:27:48 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 13/13] Mac: more profile color marks

Profile Color now also offers marks that fill the tab (a tinted
background, an outline, a fade from the leading edge, a title in the
profile color) and marks next to the favicon (a dot, a badge on its
corner, a ring around it, the profile's initial). Icon-only tabs show the
badge for the dot and the initial. The menu groups the styles with
separators; new styles are appended to ProfileMarkStyle, so saved
choices keep their meaning.
